# Story page: endless
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = The Long Tunnel
---
The Long Tunnel has no end, a fact that is printed above the entrance in very small letters, where travelers are least likely to read it.

Keep up, or be left behind forever. No pressure, a phrase which here means 'an enormous and crushing amount of pressure.'

Far ahead, something long and golden slid along the walls, always just out of reach, the way the best things are, and the worst ones too.
